B.UJ=new A.c3("nutmeg","nutmeg","Nutmeg Buyer Platform","B2B Wholesale Procurement Marketplace","A wholesale procurement marketplace connecting buyers with suppliers, enabling catalog browsing, order management, bidding workflows, supplier communication, and payment processing.","Marketplace",B.bJ,B.f1,"B2B Marketplace (USA)",B.Qb,B.Mu,B.Pt,B.Pg,B.Uv,null,"B2B wholesale buyers lacked a unified, mobile-first platform to discover suppliers, manage large catalog orders, negotiate bids, and process enterprise-scale payments securely. Traditional methods relied on fragmented emails, spreadsheets, and manual invoicing, leading to high friction, delayed payments, and poor order tracking.","Engineered a comprehensive Flutter-based B2B marketplace application using Clean Architecture and Bloc/Cubit for scalable state management. The solution integrates a dynamic catalog browsing experience with complex local cart state management that handles offline scenarios and server synchronization. Integrated Stripe for secure, 3D Secure compliant enterprise payments and automated invoice generation. Built a real-time bidding and negotiation system backed by Socket.IO for instant supplier-buyer communication.","Successfully launched a production-grade marketplace that processes high-volume B2B transactions. The robust Bloc architecture reduced state-related bugs by 40% and improved application performance during heavy catalog browsing. The integrated Stripe flow decreased payment processing time, and the real-time bidding system increased buyer-supplier engagement significantly.","2023 - 2024",null,6,"Senior Flutter Developer",B.cn,!0,null,null,null,null,null,B.Pk,B.bG)
